 SUM {
  coords 2533.354 339.334 11023.226
  m_sTitle "Summary"
  m_sTextData "<h2>OVERVIEW</h2>"\
  "Angry coal miners are sick of having their wages cut while their working hours increase. Management couldn't care less, so the workers have picked up arms and killed everyone in the complex who isn't one of their fellow blue-collar workers."\
  ""\
  "Can Russian SOBR restore order? "\
  ""\
  "<h2>NOTES</h2>"\
  "• 10sec setup timer. <b>The mission goes live as soon as you pass the setup.</b>"\
  "FIA spawn at the top of the coal refinery, with Russian forces on the ground below. You're only 25 metres apart in a straight line, but staircases, walls and multiple levels stand between you. There is no direct line of sight between spawns, but don't mistake that for safety. Both teams can start pushing immediately, and you may find the enemy at your doorstep sooner than expected."\
  ""\
  "Waste time, blame yourself."
  m_bEmptyFactionVisibility 1
 }
